# Gameplay footage review lane (FR-§0.2): raw videos + the .frames/ cache never enter git.
# *.mp4 is an LFS pattern in .gitattributes — without this line a careless add pushes whole videos into LFS.
# Only promoted evidence PNGs under GitClaudeUnrealTest/.claude/pipeline/playtest-evidence/ are committed.
testvideo/
# Packaged builds (PKG-§3): the cooked Win64 package + its zip are MULTI-GB and never
# enter git in any form. ⛔ LFS is NOT the answer here — nothing in this folder should be
# versioned at all (the same reasoning as /Models/). This fence is added BEFORE the first
# cook runs, not as a post-hoc cleanup: the editor auto-stage trap has fired live (TASK-683),
# and history is append-only. The folder's README.md is reproduced in the build-master
# handoff so the repo keeps the record without carrying the build.
packagedZIPofGame/
